        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lacu, Kari Lahtinen\n- Organizations: Hanoi Rocks\n- Places: Tampere, Finland, Northern Europe\n- Topics: Finnish music, population\n\nFacts:\n- Lacu was born in 1969 in Tampere as Kari Lahtinen.\n- Lacu is a Finnish drummer best known for playing in the Finnish rock band Hanoi Rocks.\n- Lacu played in Hanoi Rocks from the band's reformation in 2002 until his departure in 2008.\n- Finland is officially the Republic of Finland and is a sovereign state in Northern Europe.\n- Finland had a population of 5.5 million in 2016.\n- The majority of Finland's population is concentrated in the southern region.",
